  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the hot smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the cod fillets, shrimp, and mussels, and cook until the seafood is lightly browned.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the white wine and fish stock, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
  ],
